  "description": "The full Elixir album explicitly credits congas, conga dos, tumbador and quinto to several named players. This owner preserves all three named conga-family registers instead of forcing one conga_set choice to erase the others. It does not assert a simultaneous three-drum setup on every track. Oak stave and mule-hide construction and layered hand playing are authored reproduction choices; actual source construction is unspecified.",
